Package: activitytrack-doc
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: manuals of the ActivityTrack projects (Italian and English)
 The user manual, the quick start guide and the connector guides of the
 ActivityTrack app, the administrator's manual of ActivityTrack Web and the
 manual of ActivityTrack Desktop, as PDF, plus the brochure. The other
 ActivityTrack packages recommend this one and carry only their README,
 changelog and examples.
